   "text": "---\ntitle: Nothing is lost at once\ntags: trash\npinned: false\nunlisted: false\n---\n\nA deleted post goes to the trash and can be restored; a post keeps its older versions.\n\nOnly emptying the trash is for good, and it asks first.",
   "title": "Nothing is lost at once"
  }
 },
