   "problem": null,
   "scheduled": false,
   "slug": "pictures-and-video",
   "text": "---\ntitle: Pictures and video\ntags: pictures\npinned: false\nunlisted: false\n---\n\nA picture is chosen from the library or from a file, described, and put into the text where it belongs.\n\nIt is shrunk before it travels; a video is converted. What the text does not name is not sent.",
   "title": "Pictures and video"
  }
 },
 "edit publishing-now-or-later": {
  "ok": true,
  "post": {
   "base": "4dcf988b12036157537281a016819ae1d26330ce554d99726e0b1e77cb52d143",
   "date": "2026-10-05T08:15:00+02:00",
   "editable": true,
   "media": [],
   "preview": "/posts/2026/publishing-now-or-later/",
   "problem": null,
   "scheduled": false,
   "slug": "publishing-now-or-later",
   "text": "---\ntitle: Publishing, now or later\ntags: publishing, queue\npinned: false\nunlisted: false\n---\n\nA post arrives on the blog as a draft, with a preview only its writer sees.\n\nPublishing is a step of its own: now, or at a time -- then it waits in the queue.",
   "title": "Publishing, now or later"
  }
 },
 "edit welcome-to-the-practice-blog": {
  "ok": true,
  "post": {
   "base": "21fda6204f3d2ecdcdb1bd9d2d4264bb8e35e1dd2ad44de4e915d8d37eef819b",
   "date": "2026-10-01T09:00:00+02:00",
   "editable": true,
   "media": [],
   "preview": "/posts/2026/welcome-to-the-practice-blog/",
   "problem": null,
   "scheduled": false,
   "slug": "welcome-to-the-practice-blog",
   "text": "---\ntitle: Welcome to the practice blog\ntags: start, app\npinned: false\nunlisted: false\n---\n\nThis blog lives in the app. Nothing you do here is sent anywhere, and nothing is written: it is a place to look around before a blog of your own is connected.\n\n## What to try\n\n- open a post and look at its text and its properties\n- start a new post, add a picture, look at the preview\n- look into the archive, the queue and the trash\n\nTo connect a real blog, run `./blog.sh pair` on its server and scan the code.",
   "title": "Welcome to the practice blog"
  }
 },
 "edit writing-a-post": {
  "ok": true,
  "post": {
   "base": "fe4ef38d1dac2d5e4c03007b51a56621cdb32336138c506e813faa0d7835711e",
   "date": "2026-10-02T10:30:00+02:00",
   "editable": true,
   "media": [],
   "preview": "/posts/2026/writing-a-post/",
   "problem": null,
   "scheduled": false,
   "slug": "writing-a-post",
   "text": "---\ntitle: Writing a post\ntags: writing, markdown\npinned: false\nunlisted: false\n---\n\nA post is **Markdown**: a title, the text, a few tags.\n\n> The keys over the text put the marks in for you.\n\nA finished text can be taken from a file -- one dictated on a walk, say -- and goes in where the caret is.\n\n```sh\n./blog.sh add post.md\n```",
   "title": "Writing a post"
  }
 },
